{
    "title": "Triple Match 3D",
    "description": "Feel like having fun while making a positive impact on nature? Triple Match 3D is a fast-paced puzzle game where you sort and match triplets of identical items to clear the board and complete exciting challenges! Test your skills with unique 3d puzzle mechanics and take part in engaging matching games, from venue renovations to holiday-themed competitions.\r\n\r\nExperience the thrill of a match 3D game! Unlike regular matching games that focus solely on colors and simple shapes, 3D matching introduces a richer, more immersive experience. You'll be sorting and matching real objects, from everyday items to intricate designs, adding a new layer of depth and strategy. In this 3D match game, the items are presented in a pile rather than on a flat 2D canvas. As you match objects, others shift and roll over, mimicking real-world physics and revealing even more hidden objects. This dynamic interaction makes each match more satisfying and adds an extra challenge to your puzzle-solving experience.\r\n\r\nReady to play with friends? Compete in team-based eco-friendly events and feel good about your game as you work together to support real-world causes while clearing levels and earning rewards. Whether you're sorting items, uncovering hidden objects, or racing against time in special challenges, there's always something fresh and exciting to explore in this addicting game of 3d item matching.\r\n\r\n<b>How To Play Triple Matching Games?</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Tap on three identical tiles to form triples.\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Keep sorting and matching items until the board is clear.\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Beware of junk items, as they can either help you find matching items faster, or waste your time.\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Complete level goals set and become a master of 3d puzzle games!\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Use boosters to help you sort through tricky levels and shuffle the board when you want to reveal hidden stuff.\r\n\r\n<b>Fun Features:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Amazing boosters to help you sort & match faster.\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Beautifully designed levels with sleek 3d items.\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Fun brain-training missions.\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Free to play online or offline: no Wi-Fi or internet connection is needed.\r\n\r\nHave questions? Contact us at Support@boomboxgames.net\r\n\r\nJoin Triple Match 3D community and experience endless fun while making a difference. Whether you're renovating venues, participating in eco-friendly, real-life challenges, or simply enjoying a relaxing puzzle, this matching game offers endless new discoveries.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Feel like having fun while making a positive impact on nature? Triple Match 3D is a fast-paced puzzle game where you sort and match triplets of identical items to clear the board and complete exciting challenges! Test your skills with unique 3d puzzle mechanics and take part in engaging matching games, from venue renovations to holiday-themed competitions.<br><br>Experience the thrill of a match 3D game! Unlike regular matching games that focus solely on colors and simple shapes, 3D matching introduces a richer, more immersive experience. You&#39;ll be sorting and matching real objects, from everyday items to intricate designs, adding a new layer of depth and strategy. In this 3D match game, the items are presented in a pile rather than on a flat 2D canvas. As you match objects, others shift and roll over, mimicking real-world physics and revealing even more hidden objects. This dynamic interaction makes each match more satisfying and adds an extra challenge to your puzzle-solving experience.<br><br>Ready to play with friends? Compete in team-based eco-friendly events and feel good about your game as you work together to support real-world causes while clearing levels and earning rewards. Whether you&#39;re sorting items, uncovering hidden objects, or racing against time in special challenges, there&#39;s always something fresh and exciting to explore in this addicting game of 3d item matching.<br><br><b>How To Play Triple Matching Games?</b><br><br>\ud83c\udf31 Tap on three identical tiles to form triples.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Keep sorting and matching items until the board is clear.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Beware of junk items, as they can either help you find matching items faster, or waste your time.<br>\ud83c\udf31 Complete level goals set and become a master of 3d puzzle games!<br>\ud83c\udf31 Use boosters to help you sort through tricky levels and shuffle the board when you want to reveal hidden stuff.<br><br><b>Fun Features:</b><br>\ud83c\udf0e Amazing boosters to help you sort &amp; match faster.<br>\ud83c\udf0e Beautifully designed levels with sleek 3d items.<br>\ud83c\udf0e Fun brain-training missions.<br>\ud83c\udf0e Free to play online or offline: no Wi-Fi or internet connection is needed.<br><br>Have questions? Contact us at Support@boomboxgames.net<br><br>Join Triple Match 3D community and experience endless fun while making a difference. Whether you&#39;re renovating venues, participating in eco-friendly, real-life challenges, or simply enjoying a relaxing puzzle, this matching game offers endless new discoveries.",
